Subject: [fyd] ClaimBadge coverage: Links, CTA, ObjectRail sections

Claim-source standard (2026-09-22): every section that binds source objects
and renders source-derived content must name the claim source via the
ClaimBadge mechanism. LinksSection (official website/social links), CTASection
(contact CTA) and ObjectRailSection (featured-object description) bind objects
but never render ClaimBadge. This adds the existing ClaimBadge component to
all three; no new mechanism, no new authority.

Evidence: fyd-factory missions/fixtures/shard2-claim-badge-gap.json
(1221 unbound sections across 407 generated worlds in WORLD shard 2).

Repo is read-only for mission workers; integration writer applies.

